# Every finding is an error. The disabled checks:
# - cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-avoid-unchecked-container-access: std::span
#   has no bounds-checked at() before C++26. The AddressSanitizer build in
#   test:cpp checks reads instead.
# - modernize-use-trailing-return-type: style only.
# - portability-avoid-pragma-once: every compiler the template supports has it.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  concurrency-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  misc-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  readability-*,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-avoid-unchecked-container-access,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -portability-avoid-pragma-once
WarningsAsErrors: "*"
